    "answer": {
      "short": "$a^2b-c^2d$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(a\\sqrt b+c\\sqrt d)(a\\sqrt b-c\\sqrt d)&=(a\\sqrt b)^2-(c\\sqrt d)^2\\\\(a\\sqrt b+c\\sqrt d)(a\\sqrt b-c\\sqrt d)&=a^2b-c^2d\\end{align*}$$",
